# Events By Lisha – Luxury Event Planning Website

A premium and elegant event planning website designed for Events By Lisha. The website showcases luxury weddings, special events, floral arrangements, and event styling services through a sophisticated and visually appealing layout.

## Features

- Full-width hero section with background imagery and call-to-action buttons.
- About section introducing the brand and its design philosophy.
- Portfolio gallery showcasing special events and celebrations.
- Services section featuring wedding and event design, florals, rentals, and interior event styling.
- Frequently Asked Questions section with accordion-style content.
- Full-width promotional section with elegant event photography.
- Contact section with an inquiry form.
- Final call-to-action section.
- Clean footer with navigation, services, and contact information.

## Design

- Elegant black and white color scheme.
- Premium serif typography.
- Large background images and visual storytelling.
- Minimal and sophisticated layouts.
- Clean spacing and consistent section alignment.
- Fully responsive design approach.

